      "when_a_forager_finds_nectar_she_perfor": "When a forager finds nectar, she performs a figure-8 dance on the comb. The waggle-run angle encodes direction relative to the sun, and its duration encodes distance. Karl von Frisch shared the 1973 Nobel Prize for decoding this landmark example of symbolic referential communication in an invertebrate.",
