      "maine_s_20_waterfowl_species_dabblers_": "Maine's 20 waterfowl species — dabblers (mallard, wood duck, black duck), divers (goldeneye, bufflehead, mergansers), sea ducks (eider, scoters, long-tailed), geese (Canada, snow, brant), swans. Male + female plumages, habitat, diet, voice, breeding biology.",
