      "marine_biology_function_biodiversity_e": "Marine Biology: Function, Biodiversity, Ecology",
      "marine_biology_offers_paths_at_every_e": "Marine biology offers paths at every education level. Aquarist positions, science communication, conservation NGO roles, fisheries science, and aquaculture work all welcome bachelor's-degree holders. PhDs are typical for independent research; not required for many fulfilling careers.",
      "marine_debris_falls_to_the_sea_floor_c": "Marine debris falls to the sea floor continuously. Octopuses readily adopt human-made objects as shelter — Freitas et al. 2022 found 75% of wild O. vulgaris in their Brazilian survey used anthropogenic shelters. This is both opportunistic + a marker of pollution.",
