      "parrotfish_graze_coral_and_produce_200": "Parrotfish graze coral and produce ~200 kg of sand per fish per year as poop. They are critical for reef health — without them, algae overgrows + smothers corals. Some Caribbean reefs have lost > 90% of their parrotfish to overfishing.",
