      "van_giesen_et_al_2020_cell_follow_up_w": "van Giesen et al. (2020 Cell) + follow-up work resolve the molecular structure of CR (chemotactile receptors) in octopus suckers. These receptors taste hydrophobic molecules — explaining how octopuses \"taste by touch.\"",
