      "first_nothing_you_are_experiencing_mak": "First: nothing you are experiencing makes you \"broken\" or \"weak.\" Eating disorders are medical conditions that affect millions of people. They are TREATABLE. Most people who get support do recover.",
      "fisheries_omega_3": "Fisheries + omega-3",
