      "university_of_maine_fogler_library_oro": "University of Maine Fogler Library (Orono) — extensive Maine periodicals collection; the largest run of pre-1900 Maine newspapers in the state",
      "university_presses": "University presses",
      "unreadable_in_practice": "Unreadable in practice",
