      "stop_far_enough_back_that_the_bus_driv": "Stop far enough back that the bus driver can see you (rule of thumb: at least 20 ft). Children cross from BOTH sides unpredictably — tight stopping is dangerous.",
      "stop_full_stop_count_2": " = STOP (full stop, count 2)",
