      "drop_in_gravitational_pe_ke_at_the_bot": "Drop in: gravitational PE → KE at the bottom. Rise on the other side: KE → PE again. Friction + air drag bleed energy each cycle, so air height decreases unless the rider pumps. Pumping = doing work against gravity at the right phase.",
