      "indigenous_led_work_as_primary_not_bol": "Indigenous-led work as primary, not bolt-on",
      "inquiry_widget_no_score_no_reveal_no_a": "Inquiry widget — no score, no reveal, no answer dump. Linear scoring is pedagogical only; real stewardship has tipping points, lag effects, and qualitative shifts that don't fit a single index.",
      "intervention_complexity_uncertainty": "Intervention complexity / uncertainty",
      "investment_k": "Investment ($K)",
