      "construction_has_the_highest_male_suic": "Construction has the highest male suicide rate of any US industry (~53 per 100,000 — about 4× general rate). Combination of isolation, pain, substance use, masculinity culture that discourages help-seeking. AFSP + Construction Industry Alliance for Suicide Prevention have free resources. If you're struggling: 988 (Suicide & Crisis Lifeline) — text or call.",
